  focused complete-screen rerun passed 2 successes, the final
  `.\tools\Run-AutomationTests.ps1` passed 34 successes, 0 failures, 0 errors,
  and 0 pending with `FINISHED passed cleanup_confirmed=true`.
- `.\tools\Run-UnitTests.ps1` passed 450 successes, 0 failures, 0 errors, and
  0 pending. `.\tools\Check-Lua.ps1` passed Lua 5.4.6 syntax and formatting
  checks for 234 files. No production or packaged source changed, so a rock
